        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-PAGETURNER-RENDERMAN-STRATEGY.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-PAGETURNER-RENDERMAN-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-MAX-VERTICES             PIC 9(04) VALUE 0512.
            05  WS-CLAY-PLASTICITY-MILLI    PIC 9(04) VALUE 0850.
            05  WS-DISPLACEMENT-GAIN-MILLI  PIC 9(04) VALUE 0050.
            05  WS-TWIN-TELEMETRY-BOUND     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-PROOF-WITNESS            PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-RENDERMAN-PIPELINE.
            GOBACK.
        1000-VERIFY-RENDERMAN-PIPELINE.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-MAX-VERTICES = 0512 AND
               WS-CLAY-PLASTICITY-MILLI = 0850 AND
               WS-TWIN-TELEMETRY-BOUND = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-PROOF-WITNESS
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-PROOF-WITNESS.
